{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ParticleInteractions.silver_ratio_beta_decay_null","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.silver_ratio_beta_decay_null","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.tendsto_volTerm_atTop","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.tendsto_volTerm_atTop","kind":"theorem","line":234,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/silver_ratio_beta_decay_null.lean#L234-L245","doc":"**The large-$q$ limit returns the bare hyperbolic volume.**\n$\\mathrm{Vol}/\\hbar_q^2 \\to \\mathrm{Vol}$ as $q \\to \\infty$. This is a limit\nalong the real axis, disjoint from the root-of-unity direction in which the\nvolume conjecture is taken. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.tendsto_hbarQ_atTop","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.tendsto_hbarQ_atTop","kind":"theorem","line":225,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/silver_ratio_beta_decay_null.lean#L225-L232","doc":"$\\hbar_q \\to 1$ as $q \\to \\infty$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.hbarQ_eq_zero_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.hbarQ_eq_zero_iff","kind":"theorem","line":214,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/silver_ratio_beta_decay_null.lean#L214-L223","doc":"**$\\hbar_q$ vanishes exactly at $q = 1$**, the $\\mathfrak{E}_\\times = 0$\nnull root, so the volume term's denominator is zero there. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.volTerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.volTerm","kind":"def","line":211,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/silver_ratio_beta_decay_null.lean#L211-L212","doc":"The mass formula's volume term $\\mathrm{Vol}/\\hbar_q^2$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.hbarQ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.hbarQ","kind":"def","line":208,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/silver_ratio_beta_decay_null.lean#L208-L209","doc":"$\\hbar_q = 1 - q^{-1}$, the quantity the mass formula divides by. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.crossing_energy_one_not_on_unit_circle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.crossing_energy_one_not_on_unit_circle","kind":"theorem","line":196,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/silver_ratio_beta_decay_null.lean#L196-L204","doc":"**The unit-crossing-energy point is not on the unit circle**, where the\nvolume conjecture's root-of-unity limit lives. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.crossing_energy_eq_one_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.crossing_energy_eq_one_iff","kind":"theorem","line":161,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/silver_ratio_beta_decay_null.lean#L161-L194","doc":"**Unit crossing energy pins $q$ to the silver ratio.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.beta_decay_null_iff_crossing_energy_zero_or_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.beta_decay_null_iff_crossing_energy_zero_or_one","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/silver_ratio_beta_decay_null.lean#L148-L159","doc":"**The β-decay null is exactly zero-or-unit crossing energy.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.crossingEnergy_eq_half_heckeSkein","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.crossingEnergy_eq_half_heckeSkein","kind":"theorem","line":144,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/silver_ratio_beta_decay_null.lean#L144-L146","doc":"$\\mathfrak{E}_\\times = h/2$, definitionally. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.crossingEnergy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.crossingEnergy","kind":"def","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/silver_ratio_beta_decay_null.lean#L141-L142","doc":"Per-crossing energy $\\mathfrak{E}_\\times(q) = \\tfrac12 (q - q^{-1})$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.hoefsmit_b_squared_at_silver_ratio","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.hoefsmit_b_squared_at_silver_ratio","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/silver_ratio_beta_decay_null.lean#L79-L114","doc":"**At silver ratio, $b^2$ (Hoefsmit coupling squared) = $7/8$\nexactly.**\n\nDerivation: at $q = 1 + \\sqrt 2$, $q^2 = 3 + 2\\sqrt 2$,\n$q^4 = 17 + 12\\sqrt 2$.\n\n  - Numerator: $q^4 + q^2 + 1 = 21 + 14\\sqrt 2 = 7 (3 + 2\\sqrt 2)$.\n  - Denominator: $(q^2 + 1)^2 = (4 + 2\\sqrt 2)^2 = 24 + 16\\sqrt 2 = 8 (3 + 2\\sqrt 2)$.\n  - Ratio: $7/8$.\n","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.beta_decay_null_iff_h_zero_or_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.beta_decay_null_iff_h_zero_or_two","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/silver_ratio_beta_decay_null.lean#L63-L77","doc":"**β-decay null condition**: $\\Delta(\\text{net})$ vanishes iff\n$h = 0$ or $h = 2$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.silver_ratio_polynomial_root","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.silver_ratio_polynomial_root","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/silver_ratio_beta_decay_null.lean#L43-L61","doc":"The silver ratio conjugates $1 \\pm \\sqrt 2$ are roots of\n$q^2 - 2q - 1 = 0$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.deltaNet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.deltaNet","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/silver_ratio_beta_decay_null.lean#L38-L41","doc":"Symbolic $\\Delta(\\text{net}) = h(h-2)/2$ from\n`prop:neutron-qvalue-symbolic`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.heckeSkein","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull.heckeSkein","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/silver_ratio_beta_decay_null.lean#L35-L36","doc":"Hecke skein parameter $h = q - q^{-1}$. ","signatureChunk":0}]}